  randomFlavorTexts:
  - Morokei summons a spectral swordsman to stab toward the two of them.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally wielding a great-axe, who flings it toward both
    of them.
  - Morokei summons a spectral swordsman who stabs his sword directly at the dynamic
    duo.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who fires arrows in pairs of two.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who grasps directly at Yuri and Sayori.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who slashes his great-axe toward the pair.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who flings splitting ice spikes at them.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who unleashes a small blizzard upon the battlefield.
  - Morokei summons an undead ally who unleashes great beams of fire, attempting
    to flambe Yuri and Sayori.
  - Morokei summons an ambidexterous undead ally who flings both frost and flame
    at Sayori and Yuri.
  maxHealth: 100
