  defeatText: Morokei succumbs to his weakened state, turning into a pile of ash
    with only the Staff of Magnus and his mask remaining.
  nameText: Morokei
  blurbText: Yeah, this self-sacrifice plot point is a <i>little</i> contrived. I
    do think how I handled it was pretty interesting, though!
